  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Positioned in a highly sought-after location, this property is all about land, outlook, and future potential. Set on a generous 1,070sqm (approx) freehold title, it presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium site with stunning views across to Rangitoto Island, the Hauraki Gulf and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe existing home provides a functional and comfortable base to live in or rent out while you plan the next steps. While the home itself is undercapitalised on the site, the true value lies in the exceptional elevation, expansive near-level section and breathtaking outlook.\r\n\r\nZoned 'Mixed Housing Suburban', whether you choose to refresh, rebuild, maximise the building height under the zoning to capture more expansive views or explore future development potential (subject to council approval), opportunities of this scale in such a tightly held area are increasingly rare. This is a property that rewards vision - ideal for families, developers, or land-bankers seeking long-term value in a blue-chip location.",
